pany, based in Bellevue, Wash., expects more than half of its production to be zero-emissions vehicles by 2035. Paccar\u2019s brands have also been refuting the stereotype that electric haulers can\u2019t tackle steep hills: Earlier this year, the DAF CF Electric truck became the first battery-electric heavy truck to tame Austria\u2019s highest mountain pass, on the Grossglockner High Alpine Road."}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2022, "rank": 151, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "worlds-most-admired-companies", "title": "World's Most Admired Companies", "year": 2021, "rank": null, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2021, "rank": 159, "itemDescription": "Paccar is a light-, medium-, and heavy-duty truck manufacturer that also provides technical and financial services support for its products."}, {"slug": "worlds-most-admired-companies", "title": "World's Most Admired Companies", "year": 2020, "rank": null, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "global500", "title": "Fortune Global 500", "year": 2020, "rank": 497, "itemDescription": "The company manufactures light, medium, and heavy duty trucks under the brand names Peterbilt, Kenworth, and DAF."}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2020, "rank": 118, "itemDescription": "The company manufactures light, medium, and heavy duty trucks under the brand names Peterbilt, Kenworth, and DAF."}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2019, "rank": 130, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "worlds-most-admired-companies", "title": "World's Most Admired Companies", "year": 2018, "rank": null, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2018, "rank": 155, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "worlds-most-admired-companies", "title": "World's Most Admired Companies", "year": 2017, "rank": null, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2017, "rank": 164, "itemDescripti